{
  "chunk": 269,
  "base": "0x3C9C800",
  "align": "center",
  "messages": [
    {
      "offset": "0x0002",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "How can I let you know？",
      "text": [
        "我该如何让你知道？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0032",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "I wish you’re never hurt",
      "text": [
        "但愿你永不受伤"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0064",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "If you have a soft heart",
      "text": [
        "若你有一颗柔软的心"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0096",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "I’m not made a sad feeling",
      "text": [
        "我并非为悲伤而生"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x00CC",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Nothing can be seen",
      "text": [
        "什么也看不见"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x00F4",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "This world is believed",
      "text": [
        "这世界仍被相信"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0122",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Why do you fight again？",
      "text": [
        "你为何再次战斗？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0152",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Tell me，，",
      "text": [
        "告诉我，，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0166",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "If it can smile again",
      "text": [
        "若还能再次微笑"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0192",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Chosen way is believed",
      "text": [
        "选定之路被人相信"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x01C0",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "It’s sworn to the heart",
      "text": [
        "已对心许下誓言"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x01F0",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "A bond with the friend",
      "text": [
        "与友人的羁绊"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x021E",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Though there is no form",
      "text": [
        "尽管没有形体"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x024E",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Such a word holds me",
      "text": [
        "这句话支撑着我"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0278",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "The dream of the truth",
      "text": [
        "真实的梦境"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x02A6",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "With you，，",
      "text": [
        "与你，，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x02BC",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Though there is much lonely thought",
      "text": [
        "尽管有许多孤独的念头"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0304",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "I want to believe your words",
      "text": [
        "我想相信你的话"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x033E",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Even if，a little smile，too",
      "text": [
        "哪怕，一点微笑，也好"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0374",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "That’s happy for me，too",
      "text": [
        "那对我也是幸福"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x03A4",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "If there is gentle feeling",
      "text": [
        "若有温柔的心意"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x03DA",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "I want to stare at you more",
      "text": [
        "我想再多看你一眼"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0412",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "To feel your heart beat",
      "text": [
        "去感受你的心跳"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0442",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "As feeling your warmth",
      "text": [
        "感受着你的温暖"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0470",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "I shut my eyes again",
      "text": [
        "我再次闭上眼睛"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x049A",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "And pray future hope",
      "text": [
        "并祈祷未来的希望"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x04C4",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "there are no tears",
      "text": [
        "便没有泪水"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x04EA",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "With love，，",
      "text": [
        "带着爱，，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0502",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "You will know that you’re not dreaming",
      "text": [
        "你会知道自己不是在做梦"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x0550",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "A day to know love is near now",
      "text": [
        "懂得爱的日子已经临近"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x058E",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "Even if I am not here",
      "text": [
        "即便我不在这里"
      ]
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x05BA",
      "type": "subtitle",
      "source": "I pray you from the sky",
      "text": [
        "我从天上为你祈祷"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
